<p>NOTE: In last quarter 1995, co reversed valuation allowance relating to net operating loss carryforwards and adjusted associated items of goodwill. This resulted in recording deferred tax asset. Beginning 1996, co is recording tax provision based upon federal statutory rate. Co has substantial net operating loss carryforwards and will actually pay only alternative minimum tax and operating cash flow will not be affected by the recording of the tax provision. As a result, co showing third quarter and first nine month 1995 summary statements of income on pro forma basis by applying the federal statutory income tax rate, as well as showing third quarter and first nine month 1995 summary statements of income as actually presented in 1995.</p>
